---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import BlacksandLogo from '../components/BlacksandLogo.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const pubs = (await getCollection('publications'))
  .filter((p) => p.data.type === 'journal')
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.year - a.data.year)
  .slice(0, 4);
const news = (await getCollection('news'))
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.sort - a.data.sort)
  .slice(0, 6);
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Base title="Home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow"><i>01</i> / Myongji University · Yongin, Korea</span>
        <h1>Distributed AI and Networked Robotics <span class="accent">(DAN)</span> Lab</h1>
        <p class="tagline">— where intelligence goes physical</p>
        <p class="lede">
          We study distributed AI for networked robotic systems — federated learning across
          devices and borders, on-device NPU inference, and the wireless networks that bind
          intelligent machines together in the physical world.
        </p>
        <p class="ko-name">분산 AI 및 네트워크 로보틱스 연구실</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn primary" href={`${base}/research`}>Our research</a>
          <a class="btn" href="mailto:hhpark@mju.ac.kr">Join the lab</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-startup">
        <span class="startup-label">Startup · Spin-off</span>
        <BlacksandLogo />
        <div class="startup-name">Blacksand Labs</div>
        <div class="startup-ko">(주)블랙샌드랩스</div>
        <div class="startup-ceo">CEO 박현희 / CEO Hyunhee Park</div>
        <p>
          DAN Lab의 연구를 제품으로 잇는 SW/HW 스타트업.
          AI 반도체와 NPU 추론, 객체탐지·영상분석, 이종 로봇
          피지컬 AI를 만듭니다.
        </p>
        <div class="startup-tags">
          AI Semiconductor<br />
          NPU Inference<br />
          Object Detection · Video Analytics<br />
          Heterogeneous-Robot Physical AI
        </div>
        <a class="btn" href={`${base}/blacksand`}>About Blacksand Labs</a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow"><i>02</i> / Research</span>
        <h2>Three pillars, one system</h2>
        <p>지능이 물리 세계에서 동작하려면 학습·인지·연결이 하나의 시스템으로 설계되어야 합니다.<br />DAN Lab은 이 세 축을 함께 연구합니다.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillars">
        <div class="pillar">
          <span class="tag">Distributed AI</span>
          <h3>연합학습과 분산 지능</h3>
          <p>데이터를 공유하지 않고 국경과 기기를 넘어 협력하는 학습 시스템을 만듭니다.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Federated learning (FedAWT, FedWT)</li>
            <li>UAV·ad-hoc network aggregation</li>
            <li>Cross-border collaborative AI</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <span class="tag">Networked Robotics</span>
          <h3>로봇 인지와 협조 제어</h3>
          <p>네트워크로 연결된 로봇이 3차원 환경을 인지하고 함께 동작하도록 합니다.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>3D point cloud perception · ROI detection</li>
            <li>Multi-robot manipulation</li>
            <li>Indoor positioning for physical AI</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <span class="tag">On-device Intelligence</span>
          <h3>NPU 추론과 무선 표준</h3>
          <p>엣지 디바이스의 NPU 추론과 이를 뒷받침하는 차세대 무선 기술을 연구합니다.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>On-device NPU inference</li>
            <li>Wi-Fi 7 multi-link operation</li>
            <li>IEEE 802 standardization</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow"><i>03</i> / Selected Publications</span>
        <h2>Recent SCI journal papers</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="pub-list">
        {pubs.map((p) => (
          <article class="pub">
            <div class="year">{p.data.year}</div>
            <div>
              <div class="title">{p.data.title}</div>
              <div class="authors">{p.data.authors}</div>
              <div class="venue">{p.data.venue}</div>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:20px;"><a href={`${base}/publications`}>All publications →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow"><i>04</i> / What's New</span>
        <h2>Latest from the lab</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="news-list">
        {news.map((n) => (
          <div class="news-item">
            <div class="date">{n.data.date}</div>
            <div class="body">
              {n.data.body}
              {n.data.en && <div class="body-en">{n.data.en}</div>}
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:20px;"><a href={`${base}/news`}>More news →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow"><i>05</i> / Join Us</span>
        <h2>Looking for motivated researchers</h2>
        <p>
          We are looking for motivated postdoctoral scholars and graduate students with backgrounds in
          robotics, AI/ML, wireless communications, on-device AI (NPU inference), and related fields.
          Undergraduates are also welcome to apply to gain research experience.
          Please send your CV and academic transcripts to <a href="mailto:hhpark@mju.ac.kr">hhpark [at] mju.ac.kr</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
